  "min_supported": "0.5.0-alpha",
  "notes": "Security and payment fixes: a token sent to two payment requests at once can no longer pay both, late payments after a long outage are collected again on busy shops, a lone price source can no longer move fiat prices, and backup mints are maintained and protected. Upgrade now, keeping your data folder."
